The detections in library/ and anything produced by import.sh are derived from the
SigmaHQ rules repository (https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma), converted to Splunk SPL by
sigma2splunk. Each file records its origin under `provenance` (sigma_id, sigma_author).

